codelaw-rules-django

The rules are reimplementations written for codelaw. Their `ported_from:`
fields name the Ruff rule codes (https://docs.astral.sh/ruff, MIT License)
whose documented behaviour they reproduce; for Django these come from
flake8-django (GPL-2.0: behaviour only, no text) and Ruff (MIT). No code or documentation text of either is included.
